#X text 35 181 Formant synthesis generates sounds by shaping the spectrum with resonant peaks and is commonly used to produce vowel-like sounds. Since formant synthesis models the resonances of physical sound producing systems \, it can be regarded as a simplified form of acoustic or physical modeling., f 52;
